      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Native bottom-tab colors and labels, with SVG stand-ins for SF Symbols. Safe-area sizing is owned by native navigation, not this preview.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\" aria-label=\"Main\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 3l9 8M5 10v11h5v-7h4v7h5V10\"/></svg><span>Home</span></button><button class=\"ds-tab\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 3h14v18H5zM8 3v18M11 7h5M11 11h5\"/></svg><span>Diary</span></button><button class=\"ds-tab\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 2-2.5 2-2.5 4M12 17h.01\"/></svg><span>Support</span></button><button class=\"ds-tab\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m10 3-1 3-3 1-3 3 2 2-2 2 3 3 3 1 1 3h4l1-3 3-1 3-3-2-2 2-2-3-3-3-1-1-3z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>Settings</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E8E3EC;padding-top:8px;max-width:390px;} .ds-tab{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;min-height:44px;padding:0 8px 8px;border:0;background:transparent;color:#6B6476;font:500 12px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;} .ds-tab[aria-current]{color:#694D98;} .ds-tab:hover,.ds-tab:active{opacity:.8;} .ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #694D98;outline-offset:-2px;} @media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-tabs{background:#24202D;border-color:#393140;} .ds-tab{color:#B4ABBE;} .ds-tab[aria-current]{color:#C8A9F5;} .ds-tab:focus-visible{outline-color:#C8A9F5;}}",
